          "attachment_identity": "python:The-Interdependency/interdependent-lib:libs/pcea/src/instance.py::class:PCEAInstance",
          "description": "Maintains last_state (list of seeds) internally. After each encrypt call\nlast_state advances to the plaintext seeds. The receiver's decrypt call\nmirrors this. Both sides must be initialized with the same seed and\nprocess states in the same order.",
