          "text": "Vertex visitation order of the {n/step} star polygon.\n\n    For n = 7: step 2 -> [0,2,4,6,1,3,5]; step 3 -> [0,3,6,2,5,1,4]. Requires\n    gcd(step, n) == 1 so every vertex is visited exactly once.\n    "
