          "description": "r:      log-depth ∈ [0, ∞).  r = log(len(A_plus)).\ntheta:  circular mean angle on R/4πZ ∈ [0, 4π).  None = degenerate.\nz:      flip_parity ∈ {0, 1}.  Parity of face-flip count.\nw:      len_parity  ∈ {0, 1}.  Parity of sequence length.",
