          "description": "r:     additive.\ntheta: additive mod 4π (degenerate if either is degenerate).\nz:     (z_p * w_q + w_p * z_q) mod 2   — XOR outer-product rule.\nw:     (w_p * w_q) mod 2               — multiplicative.",
